OL,3,GNEWSATwo men killed in separate road
OL,4,Acrashes in County Antrim
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have died following separate
OL,7,Froad traffic collisions in Co Antrim on
OL,8,FWednesday.
OL,10,FPhilip McMeekan (52) from Comber,
OL,11,FCounty Down, died when his motorcycle
OL,12,Fcrashed on the Shore Road in
OL,13,FCarrickfergus.
OL,15,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,16,F(PSNI) received a report at about 19:25
OL,17,FBST of a crash involving a Triumph
OL,18,FRocket motorcycle.
OL,20,FOfficers attended, alongside other
OL,21,Femergency services, but the man was
OL,22,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
